    <item>
      <title>Ordeal of the Demon King</title>
      <author>- Tarnagh -</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/712592</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/712592#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">cbda0cfd816f03a3fa3ef6fd9b4a3e4bdb3e749b</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 19:08:11 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a970c1f9d9e3.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a96fae3bb3c0.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a96fae3ed1b9.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; v1.1.0&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Improvement&lt;/em&gt;: Ganondorf does not insta-kill you now like Phantom Ganon.&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Created by &lt;strong&gt;Tarnagh&lt;/strong&gt;. Bow model and texture by &lt;strong&gt;The Hidden Yiga Clan&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h2&gt;Ordeal of the Demon King&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;em&gt;"You have faced monsters, Dragons, and gods. But have you ever stood before the Demon King himself?"&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;hr&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h2&gt;The Demon King&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
&#13;
The Demon King has watched the bearer of the Master Sword from afar.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
Ganondorf does not seek another meaningless battle. He has seen the hero's victories, his strength, and the countless enemies he has overcome. Now, he wishes to determine whether the wielder of the legendary blade is truly worthy to stand before him.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
When you finally approach him, he will offer you a choice.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;strong&gt;Kneel.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;strong&gt;Or refuse.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&#13;
Choose carefully. The Demon King does not offer his mercy twice.&#13;
&#13;
&lt;hr&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h2&gt;The Ordeal&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
&#13;
Those who bow before Ganondorf will receive an honour rarely granted to any mortal: the opportunity to prove themselves before the King of Demons.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
But honour must be earned.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
Accept his trial, and face an opponent worthy of your strength. Survive, and Ganondorf will acknowledge that you are more than another hero clinging to a dying world.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
Refuse his challenge, and the ordeal ends where it began - beneath the gaze of the Demon King.&#13;
&#13;
&lt;hr&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h2&gt;The King's Will&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
&#13;
Ganondorf has more in mind than a single trial.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
Those who prove themselves may earn his attention and be entrusted with a task that reaches far beyond a simple test of strength. Ancient powers, formidable creatures, forgotten relics, and a weapon of terrible power await those willing to carry out the Demon King's will.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
But do not mistake his favour for friendship.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
You serve his purpose only for as long as you remain useful to him.&#13;
&#13;
&lt;hr&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h2&gt;Features&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;ul&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Demon King:&lt;/strong&gt; Encounter Ganondorf as he was meant to be - imposing, calculating, merciless, and worthy of his title.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The King's Trial:&lt;/strong&gt; Prove your strength in a battle personally chosen by Ganondorf.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Choices and Consequences:&lt;/strong&gt; Your decisions before the Demon King determine your fate.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Quest:&lt;/strong&gt; Earn Ganondorf's attention and undertake a task worthy of the Demon King.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unique Reward:&lt;/strong&gt; Discover a relic forged from the powers of Dragons and Hyrule's most formidable creatures.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Persistent Progress:&lt;/strong&gt; Your deeds and progress through the Demon King's quests are preserved across your adventures.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;hr&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h2&gt;Begin the Ordeal&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;ol&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Find the Demon King north of the Gerudo Canyon Pass, and west of the Rakakudaj Shrine.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Approach him and hear his demand.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Choose whether to kneel before him or refuse.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;If you survive, decide whether to accept his trial.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Prove yourself worthy before the Demon King.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Earn his attention and discover what he demands of you next.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ol&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;hr&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h2&gt;Technical Specifications&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;em&gt;For developers and modders:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;ul&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Primary Character:&lt;/strong&gt; Ganondorf&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quest System:&lt;/strong&gt; EventFlow&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dialogue System:&lt;/strong&gt; Mals&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Persistent Progress:&lt;/strong&gt; GameData and SaveData&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Custom Equipment:&lt;/strong&gt; Crystallized Ice Bow (&lt;em&gt;Weapon_Bow_166_For_Ganondorf&lt;/em&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;hr&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h3&gt;The Ordeal Awaits&lt;/h3&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;em&gt;Stand before the Demon King. Prove your worth. And remember - he is the one deciding whether you deserve to live.&lt;/em&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/ordeal_of_the_demon_king_31be2.zip" type="application/zip"/>
      <category>Quests</category>
      <category>AI &amp; Events</category>
    </item>
