: - [Addition]: New [Coral] enemy tier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Wanderer] enemy tier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Zonai] enemy tier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Lava] enemy tier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Spirit] armor set.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Coral] armor set.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Wanderer] armor set.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Zonai] armor set.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Lava] armor set.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Swordsman] armor set.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Wraith] weapon tier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Spirit] weapon tier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Coral] weapon tier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Wanderer] weapon tier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Lava] weapon tier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Elite Guard] weapon tier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Fragments of the Past] quest.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Hebra] regional mount.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Gerudo Highlands] regional mount.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Gerudo] regional mount.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Central Hyrule] regional mount.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Eldin] regional mount.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Lanayru] regional mounts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Faron] regional mount.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Adjustment&lt;/em&gt;: - [Adjustment]: A way to re-obtain the [Infamous Servant] set of weapons have been implemented.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Adjustment&lt;/em&gt;: - [Adjustment]: The [Tainted Armos Heart] is now a fire material&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Adjustment&lt;/em&gt;: - [Adjustment]: The [Abyssal] lynel now wields the [Spirit] set of weapons&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Adjustment&lt;/em&gt;: - [Adjustment]: Several other smaller adjustments were made.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: - [Bugfix]: Gigantic plants pop-in issues and graphical issues on the giant mushrooms were fixed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: - [Bugfix]: Some things I no longer remember.&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/iMcYl_k4pKM" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen=""&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://discord.gg/gmfhR4pgtG" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Discord Server.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.patreon.com/PotatoFried" target="_blank"&gt;My Patreon if you want to support and/or gain early access to projects.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1p80n0A7ugWwYM43GguqM7GiHT-umLo4tiR28cOVj-OQ/edit?usp=sharing" class="SelectedElement" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Spreadsheet by Smbai.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Description:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;This project resembles our vision at making the entirety of the underground what it should have been, an unknown mystic place filled with dangerous enemies and unreal environments.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Main Features:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Several new enemies increasing enemy variety all over the Depths, including new mini-bosses, all of these based on existing lore and respecting the original art style.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Several new items.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;New obtainable, upgradable armour sets and weapons.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;New quests and locations.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Revamps some of the chests.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Revamps all enemy camps.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Brand new wildlife exclusive to the Depths environments.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Overhauls the whole Depths environment, adding over 11 new region-based biomes without breaking the original atmosphere, enhanced scenery and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Overhauls the grass.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Languages:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chinese.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;English.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;French.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;German.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Japanese.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Spanish.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Compatibility:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;The mod has been successfully tested on both emulators and console, this version of the mod was made for version 1.4.2, there is a tkcl available at &lt;a href="https://discord.com/invite/gmfhR4pgtG" target="_blank"&gt;discord &lt;/a&gt;which will work with other versions, aside from also offering customizable mod features.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;- Compatible with CM by using a dedicated patch, available at Discord.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
